# Tauri

- Put native work in `apps/desktop/src-tauri`: filesystem, app data paths, store/key storage, window lifecycle.
- Do not port the orchestrator, memory router, or emotion engine to Rust.
- Scope FS permissions to app data. Do not request whole-disk access.
- Feature screens live under `apps/desktop/src/features/<name>/`.
- Session wiring (construct adapters, orchestrator, engines) lives in `apps/desktop/src/app/`, not inside feature components.
